Package: act
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends: docker.io
Description: run GitHub Actions workflows locally
 act reads the workflows under .github/workflows/ and runs their jobs in
 containers on the local machine, so a workflow can be iterated on
 without pushing commits. It needs a container engine at runtime; Docker
 is the default, hence the recommendation.
